 activities can be experienced in VR world.\n\n[b]Information[/b]\n\n0. No horror !!!! (developers don't like horror)\n1, Includes action minigames\n2. Full-voice supported\n\n* Part 1 is the story of DEM Team 1\n* DEM Team 2 - 4 Story Coming Soon...", "short_description": "Deus Ex Machina aka DEM is a series of VR room escape style Robot action adventure games.\n\nInformation\n\n0. No horror !!!! (Developers don't like horror)\n1. Includes action mini games\n2. Full-voice supported\n\n* Part 1 is the story of DEM Team 1\n* Next story will Coming Soon..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://looksten.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Looksten Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/Looksten.VR/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ARCADE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko", "ja", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "5759388977477014"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2042444673137114"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1009887968511541"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1307645710889130"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1138996354539504"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1244423806972875"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "251271520110174"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "251271520110174"}, "is_ap